thumbnail": {"file_name": "JUST_Podium_2560x1440.png", "id": "648143052965268", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974670_648143056298601_5199097842907333668_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-uLaaug455EQ7kNvwH7vx44&_nc_oc=AdrznS9peywohDsQzgS2oEDBF8Y2x24MvNVJEDSOq1G61ocTIauMse1EmoUpencImPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTvl8uWAaNIcDk3vB_kacdp0LsE61V7DnoPUFxLC4xKFQ&oe=6B0DC322"}, "display_name": "JUST Legal VR Courtroom Experience", "keywords": [], "long_description": "THE NEXT BEST THING TO BEING IN THE COURTROOM\nCourtroom skills are invaluable to every attorney\u2019s career. They are essential to the success of their firm and their clients. However, it can take years to gain the firsthand experience needed to hone these talents. And thanks to the current pandemic, time in the courtroom is scarcer than ever. JUST uses cutting-edge, Virtual Reality technology to compress years of trial experience into a matter of weeks.\n\nJUST is the world\u2019s most sophisticated platform for trial presentation training. A highly realistic courtroom space truly captures the feeling of being at trial so attorneys can practice arguments, depositions, and other legal presentations under true-to-life conditions. Others can replay the performance, viewing it from the bench, jury box, witness stand, or anywhere else in the environment.", "short_description": "Sharpen your presentation skills in a highly realistic, totally immersive virtual courtroom. JUST\u2019s intuitive software makes it easy for attorneys, firms, and law students to gain valuable courtroom experience and prepare for real-world trials, arguments, and depositions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://justlegalvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JUST Legal VR", "support_website_url": "https://justlegalvr.com/contact/", "website_url": "h